A||||2||Patrick||Cliff, a question about the forums.
Z||000000||Patrick||04-12-99||12:47 AM||||Hi Cliff,<p>I'm enjoying the forums, although I think I've gone a little overboard at times. Two years of <b>"FieroFrustration"</b> will do that!<p>My question regards the order in which the posts appear on the page of each forum. Why is it that new posts don't automatically appear at the top of the heap? They eventually get stacked in the proper order, but it doesn't happen right away. Whenever I check back with the site, I have to carefully read the dates and the times so that I don't call up old posts or miss new ones. It's not a <b>BIG</b> deal, but it is kind of a nuisance. Is the order of the posts something that you have to arrange manually?<p>Small complaint, I know, but there's always room for improvement. Thanks for your efforts.<p>-Patrick
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||04-12-99||01:24 AM||||The reason why they don't appear on top immediately is because of a bug in the software. I haven't been able to find it yet, but I'm working on that. But for the very same reason I had added the small "folder" icons to the left of the topics.<p> <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/open.gif">  means the thread contains unread messages<br> <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/closed.gif">  means it doesn't contain unread messages.<p>But that will only work if your browser allows cookies to be set.
Z||000002||Patrick||04-12-99||01:45 AM||||Thanks for the speedy reply, Cliff. I'm using IE5, so I'm sure it allows cookies to be set. I know I haven't done anything myself to disable them. Until you find the bug and squash it, I'll keep an eye on the little folders.<p> <IMG SRC="http://www.cnet.com/Content/Features/Techno/Gif89/Images/eyeflash.gif"> <br> <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/open.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/closed.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/open.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/closed.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/open.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/closed.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/open.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/closed.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/open.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/closed.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/open.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://212.206.1.44/ubb/closed.gif"> <p>I'm sorry, I couldn't resist.
